centcomm-role-greeting = Welcome aboard, operator. Ensure station operations are acceptable, provide help and/or discipline where the budget allows, and DO NOT FORGET ABOUT THE NUKE DISK.

cburn-role-greeting = You are a member of the CBURN corps. You have been mobilised to assist with cleanup operations aboard a station overseen by your employers. Standby for a briefing on the threat profile and direct orders on how to proceed. Remember: You serve CC, not NT or the crew.

cburn-liquidator-role-greeting = You are an elite CBURN liquidator. You have been mobilised by your employers for a high-threat operation. Standby for a briefing on the threat profile and direct orders on how to proceed. Remember: You serve CC, not NT or the crew.

greenshield-role-greeting = You are an elite bodyguard for some of the most powerful people in the sector. You have full authorisation for non-lethal and lethal options to ensure that your charge remains unharmed. Remember: You serve CC, not NT or the crew.

ntnc-marine-role-greeting = You are a marine for the NanoTrasen Naval Corps. Follow your orders and assignment from NanoTrasen, or defer to Central Command if you have instructions to do so. Remember: You serve NT, not CC or the crew.